5. BEHAVIOR NOTES (implementation choices allowed by the spec)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - Order IDs start at 0 and increase for the life of the process.
  - A trader may CANCEL only its own remaining orders.
  - ERROR reason strings are short English phrases; the spec does not
    freeze the exact text, only the "ERROR <reason>" shape.
  - First LOGIN (even if the username is taken) marks the connection as
    a Trader so a later SUBSCRIBE is "not permitted" rather than flipping
    the role.
  - Self-trade is allowed; the spec has no inventory or cash checks.

